00:09:11.036 --> 00:09:13.536
(group claps)

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:15.780
I understood.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.400
People just don't get me.

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:19.444
- I can't believe you guys
would even suspect me.

00:09:19.444 --> 00:09:20.940
Man, I cannot believe you guys.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:22.110
- You got too much confidence.

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:23.136
- Me?

00:09:23.136 --> 00:09:23.969
- Yeah.

00:09:23.969 --> 00:09:25.252
- You still mad.

00:09:25.252 --> 00:09:26.772
- Comics are sad.

00:09:26.772 --> 00:09:29.100
You're too joyful.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.740
- [Announcer] If you think
the mole is still in the box

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:33.540
and you want to continue playing the game,

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.743
please raise your hand.

00:09:39.692 --> 00:09:40.620
Okay.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.180
If the lights turn red,

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.820
that means the mole is still in the box

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:45.930
and you lose.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.430
The lights turn green,

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:49.730
that means you voted the
mole out and you win.

00:09:55.291 --> 00:09:58.884
(cheering and clapping)

00:09:58.884 --> 00:10:03.217
Will the mole please step
out and reveal themselves.

00:10:08.092 --> 00:10:10.675
(all cheering)

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:18.132
- We all have done a
ton of birthday parties.

00:10:18.132 --> 00:10:19.791
That really is the most
common type of show.

00:10:19.791 --> 00:10:20.624
- When you said family events,

00:10:20.624 --> 00:10:22.910
I was like my family
does not like that I'm-

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.020
- Yeah. I mean, I talk
about being, I guess, jaded,

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.000
but it's, you know, it's
like, everybody's excited

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.940
to sort of show off what
they're passionate about.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:30.870
It's very sweet.

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.580
- Well, my dad is a comedian.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:33.960
He's a ventriloquist.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:37.050
And then my older cousin,
he does comedy as well.

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:39.120
My whole family is just like so crazy

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:42.450
and full of like comedians
who are not professional

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.250
and then some real professionals.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.220
- To really just have to
be in literally a box,

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:48.840
and it's like go.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:51.420
I found that I still
possess that within myself

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:52.253
which is great

00:10:52.253 --> 00:10:56.621
because I do not have any
other practical skills.

00:10:56.621 --> 00:10:59.371
(group cheering)

00:11:03.976 --> 00:11:06.393
(jazz music)

